ONE TREE, THREE EDITIONS

This repository builds Keephaven Home and Keephaven Photos, which run on a
box, and Keephaven Photos SSD, which runs on a Windows PC from a USB drive
you write yourself. Same product, same licence, different hardware. The
drive edition's own parts are launcher/ (the Windows program and the QEMU
it runs), writer/ (the program that writes a drive and reads it back), and
modules/pc-hardware.nix.

